# Compiled golden-model binary and its generated vector files (model/golden.c
# writes these at run time; see docs/planning/tasks/002-golden-model.md).
model/golden
model/golden.exe
model/vectors/

# Cadence Xcelium (xrun) output -- scripts/run_xrun.sh writes everything
# under xrun_out/; the rest is what a bare xrun drops in the working dir.
xrun_out/
xcelium.d/
INCA_libs/
xrun.history
xrun.key
xrun.log
xmsim.key
*.shm/
.simvision/
*.log

# Synopsys Design Compiler output (syn/dc_run.tcl writes everything under
# syn/out/<design>/: logs, reports, netlist, .ddc, WORK/, default.svf).
syn/out/

# Synopsys DC scratch files. constraints/pm_dc_script_unpu.tcl cd's into syn/out/work/<profile>/ (already ignored
# above), so these should no longer appear in the repo root; the patterns cover the leftovers of runs made before task 055.
UNPU_*.mr
unpu_*-verilog.pvl
unpu_*-verilog.syn
default.svf
alib-*/
